    "shortDescription": "A scientific deduction puzzle about choosing experiments to find the unseen.",
    "description": "Echo — Find the unseen. An offline-first deduction puzzle about choosing acoustic and density probes to uniquely prove a hidden specimen rather than guessing. Features 100 Campaign, 60 Daily, and 40 Free Exploration verified puzzles in English and Vietnamese.",
    "howToPlay": "Select a probe (Density Scan or Distance Echo) and tap a row, column, or ray on the scan chamber to gather evidence within your scan budget. Compare readings against the candidate specimens, eliminate mismatches, and tap Prove & Identify once your evidence uniquely identifies the hidden shape.",
